  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SECURING BREEDING AND POPULATION DISPERSAL OF ROYAL BENGAL TIGER THROUGH SAFEGUARDING BIOLOGICAL CORRIDOR 4 IN BHUTAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PURPOSE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO SECURE THE BREEDING HABITAT AND POPULATION DISPERSAL OF TIGERS IN BIOLOGICAL CORRIDOR 4. THE PROJECT WILL HELP PREPARE A MANAGEMENT PLAN TO FOCUS ON PROTECTING TIGER HABITAT, STRENGTHEN SMART (SPATIAL MONITORING AND REPORTING TOOL) PATROLLING, AND ENHANCE COMMUNITY AWARENESS ABOUT TIGER CONSERVATION.</narrative>
  </description>
